      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/40/eng@/~cl_15__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “two years” the words “three years”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/40/eng@/~cl_15__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/40/eng@/~cl_15__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “five thousand” the words “one hundred thousand”. New sections 29a and 29b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/40/eng@/~cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "16",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/40/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 29 the following sections: “False declaration 29a. Any person who makes, orally or in writing, signs or furnishes any declaration, return, certificate or other document or information required under this Act or subsidiary legislation made thereunder which is untrue, inaccurate or misleading in any particular shall be guilty of an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding two hundred and fifty thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or to both. Power to issue guidelines 29b. (1) The Perbadanan may issue any guidelines as may be expedient or necessary for the better carrying out of the provisions of this Act. (2) The Perbadanan may revoke, vary, revise or amend the whole or any part of any guidelines issued under this section.”. (Amendment) Amendment of section 34"
      }
    },
    {
